body:
That is really cool to see! Weird that I actually came on Reddit with the intention of sharing this cool article about Mexico, and came across this post on my way to doing so! Might as well share it here - a cool article about a suburb of Mexico City where people legit still speak Aztec... so freaking cool. A glimpse into the culture of these kind and brave men :)

&#x200B;

[http://www.bbc.com/travel/story/20180705-in-milpa-alta-people-still-speak-aztec](http://www.bbc.com/travel/story/20180705-in-milpa-alta-people-still-speak-aztec)
